msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: DRTC Korean Patch\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "My cans! My precious antique cans! Oh, look what you done to em!"
msgstr "내 깡통! 내 소중한 골동품 깡통! 아이고, 이게 무슨 짓이야!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " He shakes the pitchfork as he yells."
msgstr " 그가 고함을 지르며 쇠스랑을 흔든다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "d'oh"
msgstr "도-"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "HAW haw!"
msgstr "하 하!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ": DON'T HAVE COW MAN!"
msgstr ": 쫄지 마 인마!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Big Field"
msgstr "넓은 들판"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " camps out in a big field."
msgstr "은(는) 넓은 들판에서 야영한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Leave the camp"
msgstr "야영지를 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Can Shooting Practice"
msgstr "깡통 사격 연습"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " find"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " a row of cans sitting on a wooden fence."
msgstr "나무 울타리 위에 깡통이 줄지어 놓인 걸 발견한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Shoot the cans"
msgstr "깡통을 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " barricades the flimsy house."
msgstr "은(는) 허술한 집에 바리케이드를 친다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " quickly reinforces problem spots. They now seem very secure!"
msgstr "는 문제 지점을 재빨리 보강한다. 이제 아주 튼튼해 보인다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" improvises. The results don't look pretty, but manage to keep the zombies "
"out."
msgstr "는 즉석에서 해결한다. 보기엔 좀 그렇지만 좀비는 막아 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " nails some planks on some doors, but they keep falling off."
msgstr "는 문에 판자를 몇 개 박지만 자꾸 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is attacked during the night!"
msgstr "은(는) 밤사이 습격을 받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Not trusting "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " ability to barricade the house, "
msgstr " 바리케이드 실력을 믿지 못해서, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " stays on watch all night instead. "
msgstr "은(는) 대신 밤새 보초를 선다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " manages to still function the next day."
msgstr "는 그래도 다음 날 멀쩡히 움직인다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Who should stay on watch for the night?"
msgstr "누가 밤새 보초를 설까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Who should barricade the house?"
msgstr "누가 집에 바리케이드를 칠까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Barricading Before Bed"
msgstr "자기 전 바리케이드"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "At the end of the day, "
msgstr "하루가 끝날 무렵, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" hides in a drafty old house. Some zombies roam around outside, and the doors of the house are barely on their hinges.\r\n"
"\tShould someone barricade the house?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 외풍이 심한 낡은 집에 숨는다. 밖엔 좀비 몇 마리가 어슬렁거리고, 문은 경첩에 겨우 붙어 있다.\r\n"
"\t누가 바리케이드를 쳐야 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Pick someone to secure it"
msgstr "보강할 사람을 고른다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Stay on watch all night"
msgstr "밤새 보초를 선다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " tries to help the injured moose."
msgstr "은(는) 다친 무스를 도와주려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" forgot that there were no medical supplies! The moose appreciates the "
"gesture anyway, so it only mauls "
msgstr "은(는) 의약품이 없다는 걸 깜빡했다! 무스는 그래도 성의가 고마운지, 가까이 온 벌로 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " half as hard for getting close."
msgstr "를 절반만 세게 들이받는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" patches it up a little. The moose is too confused by this gesture of "
"kindness to maul "
msgstr "는 상처를 조금 치료해 준다. 무스는 이 친절에 너무 어리둥절해서 차마 공격하지 못한다. 덕분에 무사한 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't know much about caring for a moose and ends up angering it! The "
"moose flings out a hard kick to "
msgstr "는 무스를 돌보는 법을 잘 몰라서 오히려 화나게 만든다! 무스가 매서운 발길질을 날린다. 맞은 건 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " tries to shoot the moose. This isn't very sportsmanlike!"
msgstr "은(는) 무스를 쏘려 한다. 스포츠맨십이 별로다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " doesn't have any sort of weapon that shoots! The moose and "
msgstr "은(는) 쏠 만한 무기가 하나도 없다! 무스와 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " have a good chuckle. Then the moose starts mauling everyone."
msgstr "이(가) 함께 껄껄 웃는다. 그러고 무스가 모두를 들이받기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " blasts the moose. "
msgstr "는 무스를 쏴 버린다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " gets what stringy meat "
msgstr "은(는) 떠나기 전에 질긴 고기를 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " can from it before having to leave."
msgstr "이(가) 챙길 수 있는 만큼 챙긴다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " whiffs the shot! The moose is not happy about this, and stomps "
msgstr "는 빗맞힌다! 무스는 이게 마음에 안 드는지, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " up real bad."
msgstr "를 아주 제대로 짓밟아 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" wrestles the moose! Arms lock with hooves in a test of strength and "
"willpower!"
msgstr "은(는) 무스와 씨름한다! 팔과 발굽이 맞붙는 힘과 의지의 대결!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" wins this pointless contest! It's a triumph over nature. The moose seethes "
"over the loss and saunters away."
msgstr "는 이 무의미한 대결에서 이긴다! 자연에 대한 승리다. 무스는 분해하며 어슬렁어슬렁 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:358
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't win! In a blatant disregard for wrestling rules, the moose crushes "
msgstr "는 지고 만다! 레슬링 규칙을 대놓고 무시하며, 무스가 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:358
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " with its hooves."
msgstr "를 발굽으로 짓밟는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "The Morning Moose"
msgstr "아침의 무스"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
"In the morning, there's a moose outside the camp! It looks injured, and is "
"just glaring at "
msgstr "아침이 되자 야영지 밖에 무스가 있다! 다친 것 같은데, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tEven injured, a moose is a really powerful creature. Probably best to not mess with it."
msgstr "을(를) 노려보고만 있다.\r\n\t다쳤다 해도 무스는 아주 강한 동물이다. 건드리지 않는 게 좋겠다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Leave moose alone"
msgstr "무스를 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:367
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " treats its injury"
msgstr "이(가) 상처를 치료한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " shoots the moose"
msgstr "이(가) 무스를 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " wrestles the moose"
msgstr "이(가) 무스와 씨름한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Moose in the Morning"
msgstr "아침에 무스"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " camps for the night, off a quiet stretch of the road."
msgstr "은(는) 도로변의 조용한 곳에서 야영한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:381
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " feels good about the odds!"
msgstr "은(는) 승산이 있다고 느낀다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " doesn't think there's THAT many zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비가 '그렇게' 많진 않을 거라 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is ready to splat some zombs!"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비를 박살 낼 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is raring to go!"
msgstr "은(는) 출발할 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " feels pumped up for tomorrow!"
msgstr "은(는) 내일을 생각하니 흥분된다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is excited about Canada!"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 생각에 들떠 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " can't wait!"
msgstr "은(는) 기다릴 수가 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Last Rest Before Canada"
msgstr "캐나다 전 마지막 휴식"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:400
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " prepares for the brutal day ahead of "
msgstr "은(는) 혹독한 하루를 준비한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:400
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ". Canada is close, but the zombie forecast is bad!"
msgstr "앞에 놓인 하루를. 캐나다가 가깝지만, 좀비 예보가 최악이다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:402 deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "There's food left for "
msgstr "식량이 남아서 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " to eat a second meal."
msgstr "은(는) 한 끼 더 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " to eat extra."
msgstr "은(는) 좀 더 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"CAR OBLITERATED!\r\n"
"\t\tTrunk weapons lost!"
msgstr ""
"차 완전 박살!\r\n"
"\t\t트렁크 무기 분실!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "CAR DESTROYED!"
msgstr "차 파괴!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "CAR STOLEN!"
msgstr "차 도난!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:33 deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "CAR ABANDONED!"
msgstr "차 포기!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " expertly repairs the car in no time at all!"
msgstr "는 순식간에 능숙하게 차를 고친다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The repairs takes a good part of the day."
msgstr "수리하는 데 하루의 상당 부분이 걸린다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The repairs take a good part of the day, and are very difficult."
msgstr "수리하는 데 하루의 상당 부분이 걸리고, 아주 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " has no idea what "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "'s doing, and wastes a day's time pretending to work on the car."
msgstr "가 뭘 하는지도 모르고, 차를 고치는 척하며 하루를 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " easily repairs the car in no time!"
msgstr "은(는) 금세 쉽게 차를 고친다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " somehow manages to get the car running, but it takes a full day."
msgstr "는 하루 꼬박 걸렸지만 어찌어찌 차를 굴러가게 만든다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:149 deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The next time this car breaks down, "
msgstr "다음에 이 차가 고장 나면, "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " absolutely won't be able to repair it."
msgstr "은(는) 절대 고칠 수 없을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " won't be able to repair it unless "
msgstr "은(는) 고칠 수 없을 것이다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " mechanic skill is higher!"
msgstr " 기계 실력이 더 높아지지 않는 한!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " wastes a day trying to repair the car, but it refuses to start."
msgstr "는 차를 고치느라 하루를 날리지만, 시동이 걸리지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " completely fails to repair the car after wasting a day on it."
msgstr "는 하루를 쏟고도 차 수리에 완전히 실패한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " is as surprised as anyone when the engine roars to life!"
msgstr "는 엔진이 굉음을 내며 살아나자 누구보다 놀란다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car doesn't make it far down the road before some part that got punched "
"catches fire."
msgstr "차는 얼마 못 가서, 주먹으로 맞은 부품 하나에 불이 붙는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " just manages to break something in the car and some bones in "
msgstr "는 차의 뭔가를 망가뜨리고, "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " hand."
msgstr " 손뼈도 몇 개 부러뜨린다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "Funny enough, this car takes no gas."
msgstr "웃기게도, 이 차는 기름이 안 든다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " get lost for a full day, until finally finding an alternate route."
msgstr "은(는) 하루 종일 길을 잃었다가 마침내 우회로를 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "It takes some extra time and gas, but not too much!"
msgstr "시간과 기름이 좀 더 들었지만, 많이는 아니다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car rams right through the obstacle, though some of its makeshift armor "
"ends up falling off."
msgstr "차가 장애물을 그대로 뚫고 지나가지만, 임시 장갑 일부가 떨어져 나간다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car gets through, but takes some damage."
msgstr "차가 통과하지만 피해를 입는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car got through, but took too much damage. It fell apart a short "
"distance down the road."
msgstr "차가 통과했지만 피해가 너무 컸다. 조금 가다가 산산이 부서졌다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The slow car immediately flips upside down and erupts into flames, not even "
"clearing the obstacle."
msgstr "느린 차가 장애물을 넘지도 못하고 그대로 뒤집혀 불길에 휩싸인다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car barely makes it, but sinks like an anvil and smashes into the "
"ground. Chunks of the car fly in various directions."
msgstr "차가 간신히 넘지만 모루처럼 가라앉아 땅에 처박힌다. 차 조각이 사방으로 날아간다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "It took a beating, but it's still running!"
msgstr "두들겨 맞긴 했지만 아직 굴러간다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car builds up incredible speed, hits the jump, and starts flying for "
"awhile due to the rocket boosters! It's exhilarating!"
msgstr "차가 엄청난 속도로 점프대를 치고, 로켓 부스터 덕분에 한동안 날아간다! 짜릿하다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car builds up great speed, hits the jump, and sails right over the "
"obstacle!"
msgstr "차가 엄청난 속도로 점프대를 치고, 장애물을 가볍게 넘어간다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " decides to take a detour! This is usually a bad idea."
msgstr "은(는) 우회하기로 한다! 보통은 안 좋은 생각이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car runs like new! "
msgstr "차가 새것처럼 달린다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car runs like it's in good shape. "
msgstr "차 상태가 괜찮다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car has seen better days. "
msgstr "차가 한물갔다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car may still break down at any moment. "
msgstr "차가 언제 퍼질지 모른다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
" tries to repair the car in the hope it goes a little further before "
"breaking down. "
msgstr "은(는) 조금이라도 더 가길 바라며 차를 수리해 본다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car looks undamaged!"
msgstr "차가 멀쩡해 보인다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car still looks all busted up."
msgstr "차가 여전히 엉망이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car looks all beat-up, but still sturdy."
msgstr "차가 다 찌그러졌지만 아직 튼튼하다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "Car repair and tune up"
msgstr "차 수리 및 정비"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "Drive away"
msgstr "그냥 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "OUT OF GAS"
msgstr "기름 바닥"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid ""
"The car has completely run out of gas, and coasts to a stop.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"기름이 완전히 떨어져서 차가 서서히 멈춘다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "Wasting no time, "
msgstr "지체 없이, "

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " decides to ditch the car and walk until they find a new vehicle."
msgstr "은(는) 차를 버리고 새 차를 찾을 때까지 걷기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " opens the car's hood and starts PUNCHING."
msgstr "은(는) 보닛을 열고 주먹질을 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " pops the hood of the car."
msgstr "은(는) 차 보닛을 연다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "CAR BREAKDOWN"
msgstr "차 고장"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "The car has broken down from use and abuse. It won't start up again."
msgstr "차가 혹사당해 고장 났다. 다시 시동이 걸리지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid "Abandon the car"
msgstr "차를 버린다"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " attempts to fix it"
msgstr "이(가) 고쳐 본다"

#: deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/carlogic.df"
msgid " punches the car"
msgstr "이(가) 차를 주먹으로 때린다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "RUFFIN IT"
msgstr "야생 체험"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a nice spot to camp for the night in the woods. Wind and rain move in"
" during the night catching "
msgstr "은(는) 숲속에서 하룻밤 묵기 좋은 곳을 찾는다. 밤사이 비바람이 몰아쳐 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " by surprise. It is a miserable night with no car to retreat to."
msgstr "을(를) 덮친다. 피할 차도 없는 비참한 밤이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "ABANDONED LUCK"
msgstr "버려진 행운"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" is fortunate to find an abandoned cabin in the woods to stay the night in. "
"Shortly after setting up, a storm moved in. Lucky for "
msgstr "은(는) 운 좋게 숲속에서 버려진 오두막을 찾아 하룻밤 묵는다. 자리를 잡자마자 폭풍이 몰려왔다. 다행히 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " that "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " found the cabin in time."
msgstr "제때 오두막을 찾았다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "JUST CAMPING"
msgstr "그냥 야영"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " decides to set up camp for the night and try to eat a meal."
msgstr "은(는) 야영을 하고 밥을 먹어 보기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "PEACEFUL CAMP"
msgstr "평화로운 야영"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "After a long hike "
msgstr "긴 도보 끝에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " finds a nice clearing to set up camp. The weather is nice and "
msgstr "은(는) 야영하기 좋은 공터를 찾는다. 날씨도 좋아서 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " is able to rest peacefully."
msgstr "은(는) 편히 쉴 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "BUGS AND CAMPING"
msgstr "벌레와 야영"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "After a long walk "
msgstr "긴 도보 끝에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " decides to set up camp. Unfortunately "
msgstr "은(는) 야영을 하기로 한다. 안타깝게도 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " is assaulted by mosquitoes during the night and "
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 모기떼의 습격을 받고, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " get"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " no sleep."
msgstr "한숨도 못 잔다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "LONG DAY"
msgstr "긴 하루"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "After an entire day of walking "
msgstr "하루 종일 걸은 끝에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " finds a safe camping spot. "
msgstr "은(는) 안전한 야영지를 찾는다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " is very hungry, and "
msgstr "은(는) 몹시 배가 고파서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " eat"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " an extra meal."
msgstr "한 끼를 더 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "ANT ATTACKS"
msgstr "개미 습격"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "After a hard day of looking for a car "
msgstr "차를 찾아 고된 하루를 보낸 끝에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " finds a camping spot. During the night "
msgstr "은(는) 야영지를 찾는다. 밤중에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " ATTACKED BY ANTS"
msgstr "개미 떼의 습격을 받아"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " and must leave without sleep."
msgstr " 잠도 못 자고 떠나야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ", thinking of the road ahead, does all "
msgstr "은(는) 앞길을 생각해서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " can to save the extra gas."
msgstr "가 할 수 있는 모든 걸 다해 남는 기름을 지킨다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ", thinking of others in need, does all "
msgstr "은(는) 도움이 필요한 이들을 생각해서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " can to save the medical supplies."
msgstr "가 할 수 있는 모든 걸 다해 의약품을 지킨다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Being alone, "
msgstr "혼자라서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " isn't able to grab anything else besides "
msgstr "는 아무것도 챙기지 못한다. 챙긴 건 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " own weapons."
msgstr " 무기뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "They grab what other supplies they can!"
msgstr "챙길 수 있는 물자는 다 챙긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " manages to grab all the food before fleeing! "
msgstr "은(는) 도망치기 전에 식량을 전부 챙기는 데 성공한다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " manages to grab all the ammo before fleeing! "
msgstr "은(는) 도망치기 전에 탄약을 전부 챙기는 데 성공한다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " manages to grab all the weapons before fleeing! "
msgstr "은(는) 도망치기 전에 무기를 전부 챙기는 데 성공한다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ", ambushed by a bear while sleeping, decides to fight! Havoc ensues!"
msgstr "은(는) 자다가 곰의 기습을 받고, 싸우기로 한다! 대혼란이 벌어진다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "The bear retreats! "
msgstr "곰이 물러난다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " is able to get back to sleep."
msgstr "은(는) 다시 잠들 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " runs and abandons the camp!"
msgstr "은(는) 야영지를 버리고 도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" rushes to the bear, jumps up a good height, and then thumps it in the nose "
"as hard as "
msgstr "은(는) 곰에게 달려가 높이 뛰어올라 코를 있는 힘껏 때린다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" can.\r\n"
"\tThe bear freaks out and runs!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"가 낼 수 있는 최대의 힘으로.\r\n"
"\t곰이 기겁해서 도망친다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " is able to go back to sleep."
msgstr "은(는) 다시 잠들 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " calmly retrieves one of "
msgstr "은(는) 차분히 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" weapons and then calmy shoots the bear with it. No big deal!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr " 무기 하나를 꺼내 침착하게 곰을 쏜다. 별일 아니다!\r\n\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" eats an enormous feast that night, but sadly don't have the time to "
"preserve much meat for later."
msgstr "은(는) 그날 밤 엄청난 잔치를 벌이지만, 안타깝게도 고기를 저장할 시간은 별로 없다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "THAT BEAR STOLE MY STUFF"
msgstr "그 곰이 내 물건을 훔쳤어"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "'s attempt at camping is interrupted by a very angry bear. "
msgstr "의 야영은 몹시 화난 곰 때문에 엉망이 된다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" forced to abandon the camp with little sleep, and must make a panicked "
"decision about what to grab, "
msgstr "거의 못 자고 야영지를 버려야 한다. 뭘 챙길지 허겁지겁 결정해야 한다, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "FAST."
msgstr "빨리."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Get all the food"
msgstr "식량을 전부 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " punches bear in the nose"
msgstr "이(가) 곰의 코를 때린다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid " calmly blasts the bear"
msgstr "이(가) 침착하게 곰을 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Grab all the ammo"
msgstr "탄약을 전부 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Grab the extra weapons"
msgstr "여분의 무기를 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Fight the deadly bear"
msgstr "치명적인 곰과 싸운다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/camp1.df"
msgid "Abandon everything"
msgstr "전부 버린다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"SUV's have crappy gas mileage and are slow. They're also very durable, and "
"they break down slowly! Just don't bother taking it off jumps."
msgstr "SUV는 연비가 나쁘고 느리다. 대신 아주 튼튼하고 천천히 망가진다! 점프만 안 하면 된다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"Muscle cars like this have slightly worse gas mileage than average and break"
" down fast. They're easy to repair and very fast, take it off a sweet jump!"
msgstr "이런 머슬카는 연비가 평균보다 약간 나쁘고 빨리 망가진다. 수리하기 쉽고 아주 빠르니, 멋진 점프를 해 봐!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"Hybrid cars have amazing gas mileage, but are fairly fragile. They're also "
"very difficult to repair, so enjoy it while you can."
msgstr "하이브리드 차는 연비가 끝내주지만 꽤 약하다. 수리하기도 아주 어려우니, 탈 수 있을 때 즐겨라."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"Smaller cars have good gas mileage. They're also fragile. Don't crash them "
"into anything!"
msgstr "작은 차는 연비가 좋다. 대신 약하다. 아무 데나 박지 마라!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"They don't make them like this anymore! This older model car is built real "
"sturdy. It's also easy to repair, but has slightly worse gas mileage."
msgstr "요즘은 이렇게 안 만든다! 이 구형 차는 정말 튼튼하게 만들어졌다. 수리도 쉽지만, 연비는 약간 나쁘다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
"Vans are big, slow, heavy, and guzzle gas. They break down slowly and are "
"built like tanks! They're also easy to repair."
msgstr "밴은 크고, 느리고, 무겁고, 기름을 많이 먹는다. 천천히 망가지고 탱크처럼 튼튼하다! 수리도 쉽다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "RUN IT ALL OVER"
msgstr "다 밀어 버려"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "While walking along the outskirts of town "
msgstr "마을 외곽을 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a small sporting goods store. It's picked clean of loot. Thinking all"
" is lost, "
msgstr "은(는) 작은 스포츠용품점을 발견한다. 쓸 만한 건 다 털렸다. 다 끝났다고 생각한 순간, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " spots an old SUV in the back of the store."
msgstr "은(는) 가게 뒤편에서 낡은 SUV를 발견한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:32
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:40
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "Start it up!"
msgstr "시동을 건다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "BURNIN RUBBER"
msgstr "타이어 태우기"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "While walking along the road "
msgstr "길을 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a gas station in the distance. Not a lot is there other than a cool "
"looking muscle car next to the gas pump. It has the keys sitting on the "
"dash!"
msgstr "은(는) 멀리 주유소를 발견한다. 별건 없지만 주유기 옆에 멋진 머슬카가 있다. 대시보드에 열쇠까지 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "DEJA VU"
msgstr "데자뷔"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a car parked in the middle of the road. They rush over to discover a "
"car that looks suspiciously like the car they started their journey in."
msgstr "은(는) 도로 한가운데 서 있는 차를 발견한다. 달려가 보니 여정을 시작할 때 탔던 차와 수상할 정도로 닮았다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " takes the keys that "
msgstr "은(는) 열쇠를 꺼낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " kept from the old car and sticks it into the ignition. It starts."
msgstr "가 예전 차에서 챙겨 둔 열쇠다. 시동 구멍에 꽂으니 시동이 걸린다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " checks for the car keys. There are none. "
msgstr "은(는) 차 열쇠를 찾아본다. 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " steps out of the car for a moment and puts "
msgstr "는 잠깐 차에서 내렸다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid " foot right into some gator poop. There are some keys inside!"
msgstr " 발을 악어 똥에 푹 담근다. 그 안에 열쇠가 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "Here we go again!"
msgstr "또 시작이군!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "EM PEE GEES"
msgstr "엠 피 지"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid "While wandering through a small town "
msgstr "작은 마을을 돌아다니다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/carfind1.df"
msgid ""
" discovers a newer hybrid car in front of a store. The battery is dead, but "
"the store turns out to be a car parts store. Finding a working battery was "
"easy!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 가게 앞에서 신형 하이브리드 차를 발견한다. 배터리가 나갔지만, 알고 보니 그 가게가 자동차 부품점이다. 쓸 만한 배터리는 쉽게"
" 찾았다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "TOE STUB"
msgstr "발가락 찧기"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:10
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While walking, "
msgstr "걷다가, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " stubs "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " toe badly. It's not a big deal, but it is really annoying."
msgstr " 발가락을 세게 찧는다. 큰일은 아니지만 엄청 짜증 난다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Bottomless Pit"
msgstr "밑 빠진 가방"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " doesn't notice a hole in "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " backpack."
msgstr " 가방에 구멍이 난 걸 알아채지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"There were so little supplies that none were lost.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"물자가 워낙 적어서 잃어버린 게 없다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " feels really smug about this!"
msgstr "은(는) 이게 엄청 뿌듯하다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "By the time "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" realizes this, there had been hours of opportunity for supplies to fall "
"through."
msgstr "가 알아챘을 땐, 이미 몇 시간 동안 물자가 빠져나갈 기회가 충분했다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "SO CLOSE"
msgstr "아깝다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While walking along a dirt road, "
msgstr "흙길을 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " thought that "
msgstr "은(는) 생각했다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " spotted a car in the distance. It was only when "
msgstr "가 멀리서 차를 봤다고. 가까이 가 보니 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " got close to it that "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " realized it was just a giant rock. What a shame."
msgstr "그냥 커다란 바위였다는 걸 깨닫는다. 아쉽다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "All Dirty"
msgstr "흙투성이"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While walking through the woods, "
msgstr "숲속을 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " doesn't pay attention to where "
msgstr "은(는) 어디로 가는지 신경 쓰지 않다가, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is going and falls into a deep puddle of water. "
msgstr "는 깊은 물웅덩이에 빠진다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " gear is fully submerged, putting supplies in danger."
msgstr " 짐이 완전히 물에 잠겨서, 물자가 위험하다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" decides to climb a tree to get a better vantage point of the surrounding "
"area."
msgstr "은(는) 주변 지형을 더 잘 보려고 나무에 올라가기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " scampers up the tallest tree they can find! "
msgstr "는 가장 높은 나무를 재빨리 타고 올라간다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is so high up that they immediately spot a new vehicle! It's not great, but"
" it'll do."
msgstr "은(는) 너무 높이 올라가서 바로 새 차를 발견한다! 대단하진 않지만, 쓸 만하다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " climbs the tree with little effort. It's fun exercise! "
msgstr "는 힘들이지 않고 나무를 오른다. 재밌는 운동이다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " spots something in the distance."
msgstr "는 저 멀리 뭔가를 발견한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "On the way up, the branch that was holding "
msgstr "올라가는 도중, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " weight breaks, causing "
msgstr " 무게를 버티던 가지가 부러지며, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " to fall a good distance!"
msgstr "가 꽤 높은 데서 떨어진다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " plan works out fine. "
msgstr " 계획은 순조롭다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " spots something in the distance, and gets to see a majestic view!"
msgstr "는 저 멀리 뭔가를 발견하고, 장엄한 풍경도 감상한다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "THE BRANCH"
msgstr "그 가지"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While trekking through the woods, "
msgstr "숲속을 헤매다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " gets pretty lost. If "
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 심하게 길을 잃는다. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " keep"
msgstr "이(가) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " going like this, "
msgstr "이대로 계속 가면, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "'ll waste a lot of time."
msgstr "시간을 엄청 낭비할 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " climbs a tree to look around"
msgstr "이(가) 나무에 올라 주변을 살핀다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Keep wandering blindly"
msgstr "계속 무작정 헤맨다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Nice Walk"
msgstr "즐거운 산책"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" continues walking through the country side. It is very uneventful but at "
"least there are no zombies or dangers in sight. For the first time in a long"
" time they are able to drop their guard and walk in some form of peace."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 시골길을 계속 걷는다. 아무 일도 없지만, 적어도 좀비도 위험도 보이지 않는다. 오랜만에 처음으로 경계를 풀고 조금은 평화롭게 "
"걷는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Good Forever"
msgstr "영원히 멀쩡한"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a bakery van that has broken down on the side of the road. The van is"
" irreparable, the bread is moldy and inedible, but there are some sugary "
"cakes that are still good."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가에 고장 난 제과점 밴을 발견한다. 밴은 고칠 수 없고 빵은 곰팡이가 슬어 못 먹지만, 설탕 범벅 케이크 몇 개는 아직 "
"멀쩡하다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Leap of Faith"
msgstr "믿음의 도약"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" gets sandwiched by zombie hordes while on a cliffside road. Without a car, "
"the only way to escape was by jumping and hoping for the best. "
msgstr "은(는) 절벽 길에서 좀비 무리 사이에 끼인다. 차가 없으니 탈출하려면 뛰어내리고 행운을 비는 수밖에 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" shows the group how to stick the landing properly with their honed parkour "
"skills."
msgstr "은(는) 갈고닦은 파쿠르 실력으로 착지하는 법을 일행에게 보여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" gets sandwiched by zombie hordes while on a cliffside road. Without a car, "
"the only way to escape was by jumping and hoping for the best. The fall was "
"painful, but not fatal."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 절벽 길에서 좀비 무리 사이에 끼인다. 차가 없으니 탈출하려면 뛰어내리고 행운을 비는 수밖에 없다. 떨어지는 건 아팠지만 죽진 "
"않았다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Cat Attack!"
msgstr "고양이 습격!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is walking along the road when "
msgstr "은(는) 길을 걷고 있었다. 그때 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is suddenly mauled by a feral cat!\r\n"
"\tFeral cats coat the United States after the zombocalypse. You never see them, but they're always watching. Waiting for any weakness."
msgstr ""
"는 갑자기 들고양이에게 할퀴어진다!\r\n"
"\t좀비 종말 이후 미국 전역엔 들고양이가 득실댄다. 눈에 띄진 않지만 늘 지켜보고 있다. 약점을 기다리며."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Rough Terrain"
msgstr "험한 지형"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a particularly rough stretch of road. There's nothing life-"
"threatening about it, it's just a long and miserable walk. "
msgstr "은(는) 유난히 험한 구간을 만난다. 목숨이 위험한 건 아니고, 그냥 길고 비참한 도보다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " get"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " bruised and battered in multiple small accidents."
msgstr "자잘한 사고로 여기저기 멍들고 다친다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Horrible Weather"
msgstr "끔찍한 날씨"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "The weather suddenly turns bad. "
msgstr "날씨가 갑자기 나빠진다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is caught in the open, and must keep moving. "
msgstr "은(는) 탁 트인 곳에서 비를 맞으며 계속 움직여야 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " forced to stumble around in miserable conditions."
msgstr "비참한 상황 속에서 비틀거리며 걷는다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "It's a good thing that "
msgstr "다행히 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " brought an umbrella!"
msgstr "이(가) 우산을 챙겨 왔다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "There are enough umbrellas to go around!"
msgstr "우산이 모두에게 돌아갈 만큼 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Things could have been much worse!"
msgstr "훨씬 더 나빠질 수도 있었다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Having an umbrella helps, but only a little."
msgstr "우산이 도움이 되긴 하지만, 아주 조금이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"There are not enough umbrellas to fully protect everyone from the downpour!"
msgstr "우산이 부족해서 쏟아지는 비를 모두 막지는 못한다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Free Meal"
msgstr "공짜 식사"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While walking along side a large stream "
msgstr "큰 개울가를 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " notices some fish in the water. "
msgstr "은(는) 물속의 물고기를 발견한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" tries their luck, goes into the water, and tries to catch some fish by "
"hand. By some miracle, "
msgstr "은(는) 운을 시험해 보기로 하고 물에 들어가 맨손으로 물고기를 잡아 본다. 기적적으로 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is able to catch a decent sized Catfish! "
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 큰 메기를 잡는다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " foresaw an ambush, so "
msgstr "은(는) 매복을 예상해서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " set "
msgstr "는 약탈자들이 나타나기 직전에 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " plans up shortly before the bandits appeared."
msgstr " 계획을 세워 뒀다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" runs immediately as the bandits start making demands. When the bandits "
"chase "
msgstr "는 약탈자들이 요구를 시작하자마자 달아난다. 약탈자들이 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ", they trip over branches and snares that were set on the path."
msgstr "를 쫓다가, 길에 깔아 둔 나뭇가지와 올가미에 걸려 넘어진다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "When the bandits make their demands of "
msgstr "약탈자들이 요구를 하는 사이: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:166
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " sneak"
msgstr "은(는) 몰래 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" behind them in a counter-ambush. They're surprised by this and surrender."
msgstr "놈들 뒤로 돌아가 역습한다. 놈들은 깜짝 놀라 항복한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" convinces the bandits to not go through with the attack. They didn't want "
"to, anyway."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들을 설득해서 공격을 그만두게 한다. 어차피 하기 싫었나 보다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Feeling pity, "
msgstr "불쌍한 마음에, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " gives them some food."
msgstr "은(는) 그들에게 식량을 좀 준다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " wants to help them, but can't spare much."
msgstr "은(는) 돕고 싶지만, 줄 게 별로 없다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Reluctant Bandits"
msgstr "마지못한 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:181
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Without a car, "
msgstr "차가 없으니, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is a sitting duck for bandits.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 약탈자들에게 손쉬운 표적이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is ambushed by awkward bandits that apologize for the robbery. They are likely new at this.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 강도질을 사과하는 어색한 약탈자들에게 매복당한다. 아마 신참인가 보다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "They demand "
msgstr "요구하는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:186
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " expected this"
msgstr "은(는) 이럴 줄 알았다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " reasons with them"
msgstr "이(가) 설득한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " somehow manages to speak with "
msgstr "은(는) 어찌어찌 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " animal mouth to say"
msgstr " 동물 입으로 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " COOL IT "
msgstr " 진정해 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "to the merciless bandits."
msgstr "라고 무자비한 약탈자들에게."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " tells the merciless bandits to"
msgstr "은(는) 무자비한 약탈자들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " COOL IT."
msgstr " 진정해."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"This transforms them into murderous bandits. No miracle here was possible."
msgstr "그 말에 놈들은 살인마 약탈자로 변한다. 기적 따윈 없었다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " pays up."
msgstr "은(는) 돈을 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:206
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " lose"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " a chunk of "
msgstr "상당량의 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " supplies. "
msgstr " 물자를 잃는다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:206
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " still alive, for the time being."
msgstr "그래도 당분간은 살아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " weapons and everything else "
msgstr " 무기를, 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " had. "
msgstr "이(가) 가진 다른 모든 것을 잃는다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " a quarter "
msgstr " 4분의 1 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " half "
msgstr " 절반 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:216
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " expected an ambush, so "
msgstr "은(는) 매복을 예상해서, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " thought of an escape plan earlier."
msgstr "는 미리 탈출 계획을 세워 뒀다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " quickly tosses"
msgstr "은(는) 재빨리 던진다:"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "of "
msgstr "의 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " supplies on the ground as a distraction, then "
msgstr " 물자를 땅에 던져 주의를 끈 뒤, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "RUNS AWAY!"
msgstr "도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " as a hail of bullets zing by."
msgstr " 총알이 빗발치며 스쳐 간다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"The plan was really simple and far from perfect, but things could have gone "
"a lot worse."
msgstr "계획은 아주 단순하고 완벽과는 거리가 멀었지만, 훨씬 나빠질 수도 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Fine! Whatever! I don't care!"
msgstr "좋아! 맘대로 해! 상관없어!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" waddles over to each bandit, then eats the weapon that the bandit is "
"holding. "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자 하나하나에게 뒤뚱뒤뚱 다가가 들고 있는 무기를 먹어 버린다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" does this for every single bandit. Everyone is too confused by this to "
"move, or even react to the proceedings."
msgstr "는 모든 약탈자에게 똑같이 한다. 다들 너무 어리둥절해서 움직이지도, 반응하지도 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " later explains that "
msgstr "은(는) 나중에 설명한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " was "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "'really hungry'"
msgstr "'진짜 배고팠다'"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"What?\r\n"
"\tWhat do you mean, "
msgstr ""
"뭐?\r\n"
"\t그게 무슨 소리야, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Eat the Bandit's Weapons"
msgstr "약탈자의 무기를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "That doesn't even make any sense!"
msgstr "말도 안 되잖아!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " eats the bandit's weapons! "
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자의 무기를 먹는다! "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "DO IT!"
msgstr "해!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "You heard me! Eat all those weapons!"
msgstr "내 말 들었잖아! 무기를 전부 먹어!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Eat the weapons! It's the perfect counter!"
msgstr "무기를 먹어! 완벽한 카운터야!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Eat weapons, but use stealth tactics"
msgstr "무기를 먹되, 은신 전술로"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" grabs one of the nearby bandit's pistols. Then they draw their own gun too,"
" and start dual-wielding!"
msgstr "은(는) 근처 약탈자의 권총 하나를 낚아챈다. 그리고 자기 총도 뽑아 쌍권총을 들기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "RAAAAAAAMMMMMMMMBOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"
msgstr "라아아아아아아아아아암보오오오오오오오오오오오!!!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" blasts a bandit before the others even realise what's happening! Then, "
msgstr "은(는) 다른 놈들이 상황을 파악하기도 전에 약탈자 하나를 쏴 버린다! 그러고는 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " quickly dives for cover behind a rock. "
msgstr "가 재빨리 바위 뒤로 몸을 날린다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " follows their lead."
msgstr "은(는) 그 뒤를 따른다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"The resulting firefight is protracted - bullets whizz back and forth for "
"almost an hour. The group takes some damage, but the bandits had it far, far"
" worse."
msgstr "이어진 총격전은 길었다. 거의 한 시간 동안 총알이 오갔다. 일행도 피해를 입었지만, 약탈자들은 훨씬, 훨씬 더 심했다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Merciless Bandits"
msgstr "무자비한 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is easy prey for bandits. A group ambushes you and demands your supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자의 쉬운 먹잇감이다. 한 무리가 매복해서 물자를 내놓으라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "All food and gas, plus half of your ammo and medical supplies."
msgstr "식량과 기름 전부, 그리고 탄약과 의약품 절반."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "All weapons, ammo, gas, supplies. Everything."
msgstr "무기, 탄약, 기름, 물자. 전부 다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThis is exceptionally cruel, to a level most bandits won't stoop to. They know it's a death sentence."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t대부분의 약탈자도 이 정도까진 안 할 만큼 지독하다. 이건 사형 선고나 마찬가지다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Give their demands"
msgstr "요구에 응한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Eat the Bandits' Weapons"
msgstr "약탈자의 무기를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ": GOIN' RAMBO"
msgstr ": 람보 모드"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ": Drop"
msgstr ": "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "of loot and run"
msgstr "물자를 떨구고 도망친다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " says 'Cool It' as last words"
msgstr "이(가) 유언으로 '진정해'라고 말한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " promises the bandits that if "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 약속한다. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " isn't let go, "
msgstr "를 놓아주지 않으면, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " will come back and burn the bridge down."
msgstr "가 돌아와서 다리를 불태워 버리겠다고."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "The bandits decide to play it safe and just attack immediately. "
msgstr "약탈자들은 안전하게 가기로 하고 바로 공격한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " manages to escape from the fight, with no supplies stolen."
msgstr "은(는) 싸움에서 탈출하고, 빼앗긴 물자도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits are intimidated at the thought of losing their livelihood, so "
"they let "
msgstr "약탈자들은 생계를 잃을까 봐 겁을 먹고, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" pass.\r\n"
"\t\tOnce "
msgstr "을(를) 지나가게 해 준다.\r\n\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " crosses the bridge, "
msgstr "가 다리를 다 건너자, 이번엔 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " lights it on fire."
msgstr "가 다리에 불을 지른다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" walked through the bridge alone, carrying nothing.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits are annoyed by "
msgstr ""
"는 아무것도 들지 않고 혼자 다리를 건넜다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들은 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " lack of stuff and crappy attitude, so they toss "
msgstr " 빈털터리 신세와 나쁜 태도에 짜증이 나서 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " over the bridge. It's not a bad fall."
msgstr "를 다리 밖으로 던져 버린다. 높이는 별로 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "While this is happening, "
msgstr "그러는 동안, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " past the bridge with the supplies!"
msgstr "물자를 들고 몰래 다리를 건넌다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" decides to ignore the bridge entirely and cross the river the old way. "
msgstr "은(는) 다리를 아예 무시하고 옛날 방식으로 강을 건너기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " leads the group out of the bandit's sight downstream."
msgstr "는 약탈자들 눈에 안 띄게 일행을 하류로 이끈다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" constructs a pontoon out of rope and old drum barrels. It works! The group "
"safely traverses the river without the bandits ever knowing."
msgstr "은(는) 밧줄과 낡은 드럼통으로 부교를 만든다. 성공이다! 일행은 약탈자들 모르게 무사히 강을 건넌다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"The pontoon crossing drenches everybody. The dirty stank river water takes "
"ages to dry."
msgstr "부교로 건너느라 다들 흠뻑 젖었다. 더럽고 악취 나는 강물이 마르는 데 한참 걸린다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Toll Bridge Bandits"
msgstr "통행료 다리 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is ambushed while crossing a rickety bridge over a river.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits demand a toll to cross.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 강 위의 흔들거리는 다리를 건너다 매복당한다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 통행료를 요구한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "They want "
msgstr "요구하는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " threatens to burn bridge"
msgstr "이(가) 다리를 불태우겠다고 협박한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ": Pontooning!"
msgstr ": 부교를 만들자!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is tired and caught in the open as "
msgstr "은(는) 지친 채 탁 트인 곳에서 싸워야 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " fight"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
". It's fortunate that these bandits aren't that dangerous. After a short "
"fight, they run."
msgstr "이 약탈자들이 그리 위험하지 않은 게 다행이다. 짧은 싸움 끝에 놈들은 도망친다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "The bandits are "
msgstr "약탈자들은 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "UTTERLY TERRIFIED"
msgstr "완전히 겁에 질린다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:344
#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " by "
msgstr ". 상대: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\tThey trip over themselves in a rush to escape!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t놈들은 서로 걸려 넘어지며 허겁지겁 도망친다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " is relieved to avoid a fight while exhausted."
msgstr "은(는) 지친 상태에서 싸움을 피해 안도한다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" makes a threatening sounding noise. It turns out it was just animal "
"confusion noises."
msgstr "은(는) 위협적으로 들리는 소리를 낸다. 알고 보니 그냥 동물이 어리둥절해서 내는 소리였다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " says something like "
msgstr "은(는) 이렇게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "WHAT DID YOU SAY?"
msgstr "뭐라고?"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " but really "
msgstr " 사실 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " just didn't hear them."
msgstr "는 그냥 못 들었을 뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "The bandits misunderstand this and are "
msgstr "약탈자들은 이걸 오해하고 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "VERY INTIMIDATED"
msgstr "엄청 겁을 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
"! They flee and scatter!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"! 놈들이 뿔뿔이 도망친다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " has no idea what happened but is glad the bandits are gone."
msgstr "은(는) 무슨 일인지 전혀 모르지만, 약탈자들이 사라져서 다행이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Cowardly Bandits"
msgstr "겁쟁이 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" is robbed by weak bandits. The bandits are of a kind that would normally "
"not be a problem, if "
msgstr "은(는) 약한 약탈자들에게 털린다. 보통은 전혀 문제가 안 될 놈들이다. 만약 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" had a car or wasn't tired from walking all day.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 차가 있거나 하루 종일 걸어서 지치지만 않았다면.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "The bandits nervously demand "
msgstr "약탈자들이 쭈뼛거리며 요구한다: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Refuse and fight!"
msgstr "거부하고 싸운다!"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " terrifies the bandits"
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자들을 겁준다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:367
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ": WHAT DID YOU SAY?"
msgstr ": 뭐라고?"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Free Boot"
msgstr "공짜 장화"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" spots an old boot on the road. It doesn't look like it's anyone's size, but hey, it's free!\r\n"
"\tThis is surely a symbol of good luck."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길에서 낡은 장화 한 짝을 발견한다. 누구 발에도 안 맞을 것 같지만, 뭐, 공짜다!\r\n"
"\t분명 행운의 상징일 거다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Get that boot"
msgstr "장화를 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:380
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Ignore boot"
msgstr "장화는 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid " didn't notice any of this."
msgstr "은(는) 이 모든 걸 눈치채지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "Immortal American Pastime"
msgstr "불멸의 미국식 놀이"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a car speeding down the road. Maybe this stranger can help them!\r\n"
"\tWithout slowing down, the driver yells out "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길을 질주하는 차를 발견한다. 이 낯선 사람이 도와줄지도!\r\n"
"\t운전자는 속도도 안 줄이고 소리친다: "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "NEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEERD"
msgstr "찐따아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아들"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walk1.df"
msgid "And then the car is gone."
msgstr "그리고 차는 사라졌다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Car Preservation Tunnel"
msgstr "자동차 보존 터널"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" walks to the entrance of a dark tunnel, filled with cars. There has to be "
"some gas and a working car in there. Also lots of zombies that you can't "
"escape from easily."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차로 가득 찬 어두운 터널 입구에 다다른다. 안에는 기름이랑 굴러가는 차가 분명 있을 것이다. 쉽게 도망칠 수 없는 좀비도 잔뜩"
" 있겠지만."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Search tunnel"
msgstr "터널을 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Dirt Road to Out of Here"
msgstr "탈출로가 될 흙길"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" sees the dirt road stretch out into the distance. There are a lot of "
"wrecked cars and a lot of zombies. At the end is one car that looks like it "
"might start."
msgstr "은(는) 저 멀리 이어진 흙길을 본다. 부서진 차와 좀비가 잔뜩 있다. 끝에 시동이 걸릴 것 같은 차가 한 대 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Try to reach car"
msgstr "차까지 가 본다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Rough Road to Safety"
msgstr "안전으로 가는 험한 길"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid " is hiking down a gravel road when "
msgstr "은(는) 자갈길을 걷다가 "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid " see"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" a group of wrecked cars ahead. Chances are there's gasoline in some cars, "
"and one may still work."
msgstr "앞쪽에서 부서진 차 무리를 발견한다. 몇몇 차엔 기름이 있을 테고, 한 대쯤은 아직 굴러갈지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Investigate cars"
msgstr "차들을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Long Country Walk"
msgstr "긴 시골길 도보"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" is walking through the countryside and stumbles on burnt out cars, with "
"zombies roaming around them. This is a good opportunity to check if one of "
"the cars still works."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 시골길을 걷다가 다 타 버린 차들과 그 주변을 어슬렁거리는 좀비들을 발견한다. 아직 굴러가는 차가 있는지 확인할 좋은 기회다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Investigate the cars"
msgstr "차들을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Last Street in the World"
msgstr "세상의 마지막 거리"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "There's a city ahead, rotten with zombies. "
msgstr "앞에 좀비로 썩어 문드러진 도시가 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" knows that walking through a city street like this is a bad idea, but a car"
" waits at the end of it."
msgstr "은(는) 이런 도시 거리를 걷는 게 나쁜 생각이라는 걸 알지만, 거리 끝에 차가 기다리고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Walk through anyway"
msgstr "그래도 걸어서 지나간다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Long Road to Walk"
msgstr "걸어야 할 긴 길"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" finds a long road full of abandoned cars and the zombies that maybe used to"
" own them. There must be a lot of gas still in their tanks, and there must "
"be a car that still runs."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 버려진 차들과 아마 그 차 주인이었을 좀비들로 가득한 긴 길을 발견한다. 탱크엔 기름이 많이 남아 있을 테고, 아직 굴러가는 "
"차도 분명 있을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Look for a good car"
msgstr "좋은 차를 찾는다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Last Stop Junk and Salvage"
msgstr "마지막 정류장 고물상"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" walks to a junkyard with a car pulled up to the front of it. The car looks "
"like it will run, and it might be the last one you see for awhile."
msgstr "은(는) 정문 앞에 차가 한 대 서 있는 고물상에 다다른다. 굴러갈 것 같고, 한동안은 이게 마지막 차일지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Explore Junkyard"
msgstr "고물상을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Good Place to Rest"
msgstr "쉬기 좋은 곳"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rest stop after hours of walking along the road. Right in front of "
"it is a car that looks like it can be driven. The keys must be somewhere "
"near."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 몇 시간을 걸은 끝에 휴게소를 찾는다. 바로 앞에 몰 수 있을 것 같은 차가 있다. 열쇠는 근처 어딘가에 있을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Check out that car"
msgstr "저 차를 확인한다"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Cabin at the End of the Road"
msgstr "길 끝의 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "After hours of hiking, "
msgstr "몇 시간 걸은 끝에, "

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid ""
" finds a car sitting alongside a country road. It's in great shape, but the "
"keys are missing. A cabin is visible to the north."
msgstr "은(는) 시골길 옆에 서 있는 차를 발견한다. 상태는 좋은데 열쇠가 없다. 북쪽에 오두막이 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/car/walkdecks/walkfindcar.df"
msgid "Search for the keys"
msgstr "열쇠를 찾는다"
